# ElisaScript entrypoint for the scanner behavior exposed by
# wasm_export_scan_reference.py. The Python adapter adds oracle pinning and a
# test-only expected-JSON assertion around the scanner; the bounded scanner
# implementation is already ported in this directory. Reuse its CLI, bounded
# include loader, component mode, and payload encoders so those behaviors have
# one implementation to verify against the Python oracle.
include "wasm_export_scan.elisascript"
